SQL Commands to create user_accounts table:

CREATE TABLE user_accounts (
    USERNAME VARCHAR2(50) PRIMARY KEY,
    EMAIL_ADDRESS VARCHAR2(100),
    ACCOUNT_STATUS VARCHAR2(20),
    ALERT_SENT VARCHAR2(5),
    LAST_LOGGED_IN DATE,
    STATUS_UPDATED_ON DATE
);


